#: b1e3db08054143de87ca60b0a8b23c24
msgid ""
"Using Linux Trace Toolkit ng (LTTng) to Create Realtime ArduPilot Traces"
msgstr "使用 Linux Trace Toolkit ng（LTTng）实时跟踪 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:7
#: ae21a18ab8194a14989be9c74352a8b0
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use `LTTng <https://lttng.org>`__ for creating "
"runtime traces for ArduPilot running on Linux boards (only)."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 `LTTng <https://lttng.org>`__ 为运行在 Linux 板上的 ArduPilot 创建运行时跟踪（仅限 "
"Linux）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:11
#: 560da636d7a446c5b750bdbe46899232
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:13
#: 9da187ec354b40b4af74414e5ed8b604
msgid ""
"Tracing is a technique used to record the real-time behaviour of a software "
"in memory and analyze the execution of the code off-line. It can be very "
"useful to understand the interaction between threads, processes, the "
"duration of certain events and the sequencing of some operations."
msgstr ""
"跟踪是一种在内存中记录软件实时行为并离线分析代码执行情况的技术。它对于理解线程间的交互、进程、某些事件的持续时间以及某些操作的执行顺序非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:19
#: fab3fd2e1e454b29968bb27504ef0203
msgid ""
"*LTTng* is a Linux tool that can be used to trace either a userspace "
"application, or the Linux kernel itself. It produces trace files that can be"
" analyzed later, mostly off-board. Lttng's implementation in ArduPilot uses "
"userspace tracing but you can at the same time monitor what's going on "
"inside the kernel, provided the kernel has tracepoints enabled (in its "
"config)."
msgstr ""
"*LTTng* 是一个 Linux 工具，可用于跟踪用户空间应用程序或 Linux 内核本身。它生成的跟踪文件可供后续（主要在板外）分析。LTTng 在"
" ArduPilot 中的实现使用用户空间跟踪，但您也可以同时监控内核内部的情况，前提是内核在其配置中已启用跟踪点。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:26
#: 66e0b004afc547f5be6ac5c6bb085f17
msgid ""
"*LTTng* has been integrated using the `Perf_Lttng "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/Perf_Lttng.cpp>`__"
" class, which handles 3 operations: ``Begin``, ``End``, ``Count``. You add "
"tracing to your code by calling the performance utility methods in `Perf.cpp"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/Perf.cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"*LTTng* 已通过 `Perf_Lttng "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/Perf_Lttng.cpp>`__"
" 类进行集成，该类处理 3 个操作：``Begin``、``End``、``Count``。您可以通过调用 `Perf.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/Perf.cpp>`__"
" 中的性能工具方法向代码添加跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:33
#: 1c4aa334a05e4c4fbc2fb056f505ba71
msgid "Monitoring APM with LTTng"
msgstr "使用 LTTng 监控 APM"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:35
#: a76b79dbfb3e472a9e71640c054bd49f
msgid ""
"In order to monitor ArduPilot with *LTTng*, the first thing to do is to "
"install LTTng on your board. The *LTTng* documentation explains how to "
"install it on your Linux distribution `here <https://lttng.org/docs/#doc-"
"installing-lttng>`__. If there is no official package for your Linux "
"distribution, you can also build it from the sources as explained `here "
"<http://lttng.org/download/#build-from-source>`__"
msgstr ""
"为了使用 *LTTng* 监控 ArduPilot，首先需要在您的板上安装 LTTng。*LTTng* 文档 `在此 "
"<https://lttng.org/docs/#doc-installing-lttng>`__ 说明了如何在您的 Linux "
"发行版上安装它。如果您的 Linux 发行版没有官方软件包，也可以按照 `此处 <http://lttng.org/download/#build-"
"from-source>`__ 的说明从源代码构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-linux-trace-toolkit-ng-lttng-to-trace-ardupilot-in-realtime.rst:44
#: aac4b6f1b3894d26a9e4e8c920734f48
msgid ""
"You can't build statically with *LTTng* enabled because it calls dlopen. On "
"bebop I had to build the whole system with armhf toolchain, which is not the"
